THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

The compiled core embeds TweetNaCl (public domain, https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/),
used only to verify licence-key signatures. The bundled sample images in
gaugefit/data/ are synthetic images generated by the authors.
At runtime the package requires NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), which is installed
separately by pip and is not redistributed here.
